# site/ is FlowStock's own product site, and this repo is its source: vulos-static
# collects site/ at build time (its public/products/flowstock/ is gitignored
# there), so what is served at /products/flowstock/ is whatever is here.
#
# site/docs/*.md are byte-identical copies of docs/*.md, produced and enforced by
# scripts/docs-mirror.mjs (`npm run docs:check`, run in CI). Prettier must not
# touch them: docs/ is formatted, site/docs/ is a copy, and reformatting only the
# copy would break the byte-identity the gate is built on. The hand-authored
# shells (index.html, docs.html) are excluded for the same reason — one file, one
# owner.
site
